{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1498943628"}, "name":{"label":"The critical customer"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-03-14T10:11:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"12420045058"}, "title":{"label":"Great idea but really?"}, "content":{"label":"I truly believe that an app like this will be revolutionary for some people, but most of us don’t want to pay to have to go out and touch grass multiple times a day. The app itself is free, but I wasn’t expecting to have to pay to use it at all, especially since you already have to buy skips so you don’t have to touch grass then. This would be so much better if you didn’t have to pay for it, which I know probably sounds very picky of me, but not everyone who wants to use this wants to spend money on an app, even if it helps cut your screen time. Also, it’s a lot harder for the younger people trying to use this app who don’t earn that much just working at McDonald’s or something, and even if they got this for themselves, who’s to say the parents would always approve of it? I know parents are unlikely to, but they just might not want their kid to be spending money on an app that might not even help in the end. So as much as I wanted this app and hoped it would work nicely, it isn’t worth it to me, but to anyone who it would be worth it to, it will work wonders, of that I’m sure.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6739589530&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
