{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1383449464"}, "name":{"label":"gogomyles"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-03-14T07:09:20-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"12419423776"}, "title":{"label":"Pretty good, but could use a bit more"}, "content":{"label":"I really like the concept of this app — it’s a creative and funny way to help me get off my phone and touch some grass (literally). The design is simple and works well, and it definitely motivates me to take more breaks. The only downside is that the free version only lets you block two apps, which feels a bit limited. I get that there’s a pro version, but even just 3-4 apps on the free version would make it a lot more useful. Overall, it’s a great idea and works well — just wish there was a little more flexibility without upgrading.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6739589530&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
